    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to have the @Lookup[@name] conjure a swarm of mothlike shadow creatures within Far range. The swarm fills a Close range area and blocks line of sight. Creatures that aren't @Lookup[@name]s are <em>Vulnerable</em> while inside that area and must mark a Stress to move through it. A PC can dispel the swarm with a successful Spellcast Roll (12).</p>",
